        <mxCell id="83NZCwSxKjrlAqhKiL8g-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Startup Mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Establish links to KMega, KPho, and kRPC.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cccccc&quot;&gt;TBD: If a connection cannot be made, block waiting for user confirmation to re-attempt or give up.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Standard Operating Mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1) Ingest InputRefreshPackets from KMega via Serial Port. For every packet:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;a) Update Model based on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;InputRefreshPacket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;2)&amp;nbsp;Pull information from KSP into the Model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;3) Update Model (Control Panel outputs) based on Model state&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4) Periodically send an outputRefreshPacket to KMega&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5) Send information from the Model to KSP (kRPC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Idle Mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Sleep while waiting for the GameScene to return to FLIGHT.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Diagnostic Mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Manually control stepper motors for testing and calibration + ...&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shutdown Mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1) Tear down serial link to KMega&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2) Tear down bluetooth link to KPho&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3) Close connection to kRPC&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4) Exit&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;labelBorderColor=default;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="131" y="680" width="540" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
